{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>今日（2日）上午7時18分，警方接報西貢清水灣二灘有泳客疑遇溺。據報一名69歲婦人偕丈夫前往泳灘游早水，其後被其他泳客發現她倒臥岸邊，昏迷不醒。</p><p>人員到場將事主送往將軍澳醫院，至早上9時36分不治，案件列遇溺調查。</p><figure><img alt=\"西貢清水灣二灘有泳客疑遇溺。（資料圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20240721/891769911624470528710862.jpeg/oyqxfxNANKeJnB59oVYBYNyx9goeLrrjlsvRXYzL0V0\"/><figcaption>西貢清水灣二灘有泳客疑遇溺。（資料圖片）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"事主昏迷送到將軍澳醫院搶救。（資料圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261102/1193856118154072064537102.jpeg/JqRfZsTtLGEKCjOk8uZ9g0YlKllo-qJM8rDJ3fKwyd0\"/><figcaption>事主昏迷送到將軍澳醫院搶救。（資料圖片）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-02T01:59:42.794103+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":149,"images":2,"source":"HK01 突發","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-02T01:29:56+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-02T03:38:26.084958+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-02T01:58:13.927668+00:00","content_hash":"4253207ed2241583c0fd85bc5886d75cfa4f102c3f94e1f6212760dfaeb84637","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}